## Summary

install_plugins trusts any marketplace already registered under the name `ironclaude`, whatever its source, and still runs the Ponytail install after a failed marketplace add or update, so the sha pin can be bypassed. Fix: install pinned plugins only when the registered `ironclaude` entry is IronClaude's own catalog directory (otherwise report and skip, never touching the user's marketplace), and skip every command whose marketplace add/update failed in the same run.

