- **Documented behavior**: Ponytail only at the pinned commit through IronClaude's own marketplace; plugin failures never fail the install.
- **Restrictions honored**: non-fatal plugin step; never remove or overwrite a marketplace the user may own; Ponytail only from the pinned catalog.
